Description: Shared R functions and command-line interfaces used across
    PlasmoGenEpi Nextflow and WDL pipelines. Provides bespoke analysis
    helpers and thin wrappers around specialised malaria genomics R
    packages. PGEcore does not install or distribute the external software
    or specialised R packages that individual wrappers call; those must be
    installed separately and available at runtime.
